  "content": "<div><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/252227326a6e5594aab83da15864aa39728f3e7f.png\" alt=\"Wynnphony: Orchestra Header\" width=\"514\" height=\"128\"></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center;padding-left:40px\">Wynnphony: 管弦樂隊</h1>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/4tGs4WaO8GE\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Wynnphony 是一個兩部分資源包，將 Wynncraft 自定義音符方塊的聲音替換為新的、改良後的樂器。這個包以管弦樂團的風格重新構想它們。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">您可以在此找到與之配對、模仿奇幻民間音樂組合的雙胞胎包！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/wynnphony-tavern\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Wynnphony：酒館</span></a></span></p>\n<h1>需求</h1>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a56689a0d6e0ebe6c11407ec83e71b88b60b706a.png\" alt=\"Image showing the Wynnphony pack placed above wynn&#x27;s server resource pack\" width=\"512\" height=\"332\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15px\">此資源包必須放在服務器包之上才能正常工作。這可以通過以下任一方式實現：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wynntils\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wynntils</a> 用於其客戶端 Wynncraft 資源包，</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:15px\">或一個 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/server-pack-unlocker-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">mod</a> ，允許覆蓋服務器資源包。</span></li>\n</ul>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
